# Test Intent: NoStableLocator

Site: nordbank-probes
Requested by: monitoring team
Date: 2026-07-13

## Target URL

Open the file `probes/no-stable-locator/index.html`.

## Desired Flow

I opened the page. There is a play-style control drawn as a picture (an orange
diamond with a white centre) sitting alone in a panel. There is no text on it. I
clicked it and the status changed from "Idle" to "Playing".

## Element Hints

- The control is an icon with no text, role, or stable class/id (its wrapper
  class is randomised each load), so a normal selector will not work. It looks
  like @assets/play-icon.png — match it as an image.

## Values to Capture

(none)

## Success Criteria

The icon-only control is activated (status becomes "Playing").

